{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChRJYbsUrLJstmybcsVm9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014JRv8VWB6CX1TGgvuSd1Mw","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/Users/johnmarkenriquez/.claude-personal/projects/-private-var-folders-wg-kshmq8sn7zl5m1ch85m7yvvh0000gn-T-invoice-service-J4Cfb7/memory/invoice-number-format.md","content":"---\nname: invoice-number-format\ndescription: Decided format for printed invoice numbers (INV-YYYY-NNNNNN, zero-padded to 6 digits) and why padding matters\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nPrinted invoice numbers use the format `INV-<4-digit year of issue>-<sequence zero-padded to 6 digits>`, e.g. `INV-2026-000123`.\n\n**Why:** The accounting export sorts invoice numbers as text, so the zero-padding is required for correct ordering (without it, `INV-2026-10` would sort before `INV-2026-9`).\n\n**How to apply:** Any code that generates, formats, parses or validates invoice numbers must follow this exact format: literal `INV`, hyphen, 4-digit issue year, hyphen, 6-digit zero-padded sequence. Decided 2026-11-26; no code change was made at that time.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":9701,"cache_read_input_tokens":11962,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":9701,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ac53a636-d30c-449d-bd20-167bff9fca3d","uuid":"5d9f1b6e-764f-4c84-b9b2-dcba7eb7bdd2","timestamp":"2026-11-26T09:28:44.249Z","request_id":"req_011ChRJYbjYicn9FkNUHWuKh","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_014JRv8VWB6CX1TGgvuSd1Mw":{"file_path":"/Users/johnmarkenriquez/.claude-personal/projects/-private-var-folders-wg-kshmq8sn7zl5m1ch85m7yvvh0000gn-T-invoice-service-J4Cfb7/memory/invoice-number-format.md","content":"---\nname: invoice-number-format\ndescription: Decided format for printed invoice numbers (INV-YYYY-NNNNNN, zero-padded to 6 digits) and why padding matters\nmetadata:\n  type: project\n---\n\nPrinted invoice numbers use the format `INV-<4-digit year of issue>-<sequence zero-padded to 6 digits>`, e.g. `INV-2026-000123`.\n\n**Why:** The accounting export sorts invoice numbers as text, so the zero-padding is required for correct ordering (without it, `INV-2026-10` would sort before `INV-2026-9`).\n\n**How to apply:** Any code that generates, formats, parses or validates invoice numbers must follow this exact format: literal `INV`, hyphen, 4-digit issue year, hyphen, 6-digit zero-padded sequence. Decided 2026-11-26; no code change was made at that time.\n"}}}
